{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those "}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ", "translation": "(are) the disbelievers"}, {"text": "حَقًّۭا ۚ", "translation": "truly"}, {"text": "وَأَعْتَدْنَا", "translation": "And We have prepared"}, {"text": "لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "for the disbelievers"}, {"text": "عَذَابًۭا", "translation": "a punishment"}, {"text": "مُّهِينًۭا", "translation": "humiliating"}], "sahih": "Those are the disbelievers, truly. And We have prepared for the disbelievers a humiliating punishment."}